     "type": "text",
     "text": "{\"answer\":\"Confirm whether the owner's Mustang has a 5.0L engine and a manual transmission—the configuration covered by recall 22V382000. Ask whether the reverse lights or driver-assist features also stop working, and seek confirmation that the camera failure comes from the unintended signal described in that recall. The owner's report says only that the backup camera is not working, which does not establish those details.\",\"scope\":\"answered\",\"recheck\":false,\"citations\":[{\"kind\":\"recall\",\"id\":\"22V382000\",\"quote\":\"certain 2019-2020 Mustang vehicles equipped with 5.0L engines and manual transmissions\"},{\"kind\":\"recall\",\"id\":\"22V382000\",\"quote\":\"The Powertrain Control Module (PCM) may broadcast an unintended faulted signal to the modules controlling the reverse camera, reverse light, and driver assist features, which may disable all of these functions.\"},{\"kind\":\"complaint\",\"id\":\"11591938\",\"quote\":\"Backup camara is not working\"}]}",
